            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/a-look-at-spains-plan-to-give-undocumented-migrants-legal-status</link>
            <description><![CDATA[Spain is at the center of the global immigration debate. Left-wing Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez has enacted a plan aimed at giving legal status to undocumented immigrants. But last month, tens of thousands of migrants tried to illegally cross into the Spanish territory of Ceuta, which borders Morocco. The incident is putting Spain's immigration policy under the microscope. Stephanie Sy reports.]]></description>
